take care of the captain right now!

121
00:11:31,940 --> 00:11:32,770
No!

122
00:11:40,140 --> 00:11:41,680
Screw off, you punks!

123
00:11:41,860 --> 00:11:43,220
This is a proper duel!

124
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:45,040
And we're not done!

125
00:11:46,540 --> 00:11:49,960
God of lightning, Timton, heed my call!

126
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,550
Whoa!

127
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:57,820
Straight into the rubbish
pile, right where you belong.

128
00:11:58,460 --> 00:11:59,960
Nom, nom, nom, nom!

129
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:09,700
You know, it's funny.

130
00:12:10,060 --> 00:12:13,800
I thought Kaido would have
announced his victory by now.

131
00:12:14,940 --> 00:12:18,540
Don't tell me he's still
fooling around with Straw Hat.

132
00:12:18,820 --> 00:12:20,917
Put that brat in the ground already.

133
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:22,540
He's just a little punk.

134
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:26,280
Kara, let's go to the rooftop.

135
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:28,200
Yes, Mama.

136
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:29,461
Sounds like fun.

137
00:12:29,920 --> 00:12:32,220
