138
00:12:32,860 --> 00:12:35,240
Now let's get the hell out of here.

139
00:12:36,980 --> 00:12:38,420
Mama, Mama, Mama.

140
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:43,980
Turning your back on the enemy?

141
00:12:44,860 --> 00:12:45,690
K-Room.

142
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:48,317
It's time for anesthesia.

143
00:12:48,400 --> 00:12:51,380
You're finished, Straw Hat!

144
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:06,400
Mama!

145
00:13:07,220 --> 00:13:08,060
Mama!

146
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:12,080
I think it just killed Big Mom! Mama!

147
00:13:12,860 --> 00:13:14,000
Oh, wow.

148
00:13:14,280 --> 00:13:16,221
Didn't know Drop could do that.

149
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:23,160
I know I hurt you with this last time,
but the incision isn't the point.

150
00:13:23,820 --> 00:13:25,120
This is...

151
00:13:30,180 --> 00:13:33,140
No, let's not be hasty.

152
00:13:34,180 --> 00:13:35,010
Chakvila!

153
00:13:50,460 --> 00:13:52,100
Oh, my God!

154
00:13:56,560 --> 00:13:57,390
Oh, my God!

155
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,230
Ah!

156
00:14:05,580 --> 00:14:07,220
How dare you!

157
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:12,230
Huh?

158
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:16,080
Something's pulling me!

159
00:14:25,380 --> 00:14:27,040
You're steel beams, right?

160
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:28,720
You don't need to talk.

161
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:31,480
You're all working for me now.

162
00:14:35,220 --> 00:14:38,640
You still got some vibes. Not bad.

163
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:43,220
You must really want my head,
you stubborn little brass.

164
00:14:43,940 --> 00:14:44,770
Come on.

165
00:14:49,540 --> 00:14:51,360
I did want your head,

166
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:55,297
but all of a sudden I feel I'm
being driven by a different purpose.

167
00:14:55,380 --> 00:14:58,340
I have a feeling Kaido's
end is coming soon, too.

168
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:07,420
Even raindrops can wear away stone
if you give them long enough.

169
00:15:08,780 --> 00:15:10,337
You think you're invincible?

170
00:15:10,420 --> 00:15:12,160
There's no such thing!

171
00:15:12,580 --> 00:15:16,040
You just haven't faced
anyone persistent enough!

172
00:15:18,400 --> 00:15:20,640
Baaahhh! PUNK!

173
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:21,840
Turn TOO!

174
00:15:46,660 --> 00:15:48,380
What the hell is that thing?

175
00:15:48,580 --> 00:15:51,109
She's super-sized and
it's bigger than her!

176
00:15:54,600 --> 00:15:55,430
Hey!

177
00:15:55,513 --> 00:15:58,100
Listen up, you old nasty hag!

178
00:15:58,360 --> 00:16:00,880
We're gonna drive you straight to hell!

179
00:16:01,320 --> 00:16:02,200
You're not!

180
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:04,100
Get in on that road!

181
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:32,400
