182
00:16:34,860 --> 00:16:36,960
Onigashima is moving backward!

183
00:16:38,860 --> 00:16:42,036
I'll drag it as far away
from the capital as possible!

184
00:16:43,400 --> 00:16:45,500
You will not harm my people!

185
00:16:46,020 --> 00:16:50,000
You will not reach the land of
Wano so long as I draw breath!

186
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:59,260
Did someone call out to me?

187
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:16,680
That thing just sent her flying!

188
00:17:17,100 --> 00:17:20,041
Big Mub's not actually
going to lose this, is she?

189
00:17:36,280 --> 00:17:42,157
I finally got you to shut up for
a second hey you you did it again

190
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:49,097
that's two times now I did a powerful
move and you followed my lead with

191
00:17:49,180 --> 00:17:52,537
something big and flashy acting
like you one get your ego in check

192
00:17:52,620 --> 00:17:58,437
because i'm not your opening act my
ego nobody here gives a crap except you

193
00:17:58,520 --> 00:18:02,317
all right then why don't you attack
her first next time anybody's

194
00:18:02,400 --> 00:18:06,757
strongest technique didn't let me
finish her off now screw that you're not

195
00:18:06,840 --> 00:18:10,637
my boss besides the next move i do
is gonna wipe her out with or without

196
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:15,720
you oh yeah what comes after the
bull a hippo an elephant SHUT UP!

197
00:18:15,900 --> 00:18:17,547
I AIN'T GONNA TELL YOU CRAP!

198
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:21,140
Oh, jeez.

199
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:24,852
Watch your mouth, Law, or the
boss is gonna kill you next.

200
00:18:26,060 --> 00:18:27,140
Hey, look!

201
00:18:40,820 --> 00:18:43,557
Shock waves inside my body.

202
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:45,577
Oh my ribs must be broken.

203
00:18:45,660 --> 00:18:48,340
That's quite the dangerous technique.

204
00:18:50,220 --> 00:18:51,077
Hear that?

205
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:52,557
Even she thinks it's cool.

206
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:53,877
Real funny.

207
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:55,237
Now will you drop it already?

208
00:18:55,320 --> 00:18:56,150
You dick.

209
00:18:58,820 --> 00:19:02,080
A life force should fix things.

210
00:19:02,360 --> 00:19:05,180
Now, Bones, come to life!

211
00:19:06,380 --> 00:19:07,680
Yes, Mama!

212
00:19:21,240 --> 00:19:23,960
