224
00:19:51,320 --> 00:19:52,360
Masira Saber!

225
00:20:05,520 --> 00:20:06,800
It's just scraps!

226
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:09,100
You're wasting your time!

227
00:20:09,400 --> 00:20:11,680
This was always a waste of time.

228
00:20:12,180 --> 00:20:14,537
You were dead the moment
you picked this fight.

229
00:20:14,620 --> 00:20:16,860
I've sunk hundreds of boats like you.

230
00:20:17,220 --> 00:20:20,200
I was ruling when you
were still in diapers.

231
00:20:20,700 --> 00:20:23,780
My power is absolute best for me.

232
00:20:23,960 --> 00:20:25,607
to be an emperor of the sea.

233
00:20:26,340 --> 00:20:27,600
Now a side!

234
00:20:28,320 --> 00:20:29,150
Ah!

235
00:20:29,580 --> 00:20:30,410
Huh?

236
00:20:32,520 --> 00:20:33,350
Yen!

237
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:40,360
